::instructions

(beef) <cut, into big chunks>
(onion) <dice>
(beef) <sear, in (pot) + (olive oil), high heat, without overcrowding> ?= golden brown
Meanwhile [
    {onions} = (onion) + (butter)
    Optional [
        {onions} + (smoked bacon)
    ]
    {onions} <sweat, in (pan)>
]
(beef) <set aside>
(pot) <deglaze, with (brown beer), a bit>
    + {onions} + (brown sugar)
Once the sugar has melted and the pot is properly deglazed:
(beef) <return, to the pot>
(brown beer) <pour, remaining beer, into (pot)>
(gingerbread) <toast, with (mustard), a bit>
    <put, in (pot)>
(pot) + (thyme) + (bay leaves) + (cloves) + (juniper berries) + (salt)
{carbonade} <simmer, 4-8h>
